{"id":180807747,"slug":"nolan-ryan-williams-visited-us-from","title":"Nolan Ryan Williams Visited Us From The Future","subtitle":"His TED talk (about Ibogaine and PTSD) is available now.","post_date":"2025-12-05T17:04:23.612Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/nolan-ryan-williams-visited-us-from","wordcount":274,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:45:39.638Z","body_sha256":"723174f8d6d1098af074538f355f6c73a616163e4e64040f2dad0a267d1d6f1a","text_words":281,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I can’t hear a recording of Nolan without breaking down into tears on the street for a moment or two.  And also, no one is immortal.  I poist the contents of our grief often speaks volumes about our true feelings.  </p><p>Nolan Ryan Williams, M.D., was the most important psychiatrist and scientist of my lifetime, and for reasons I sometimes find perplexing, he was very much part of my life.  Nolan had a message, for us mortals, which was that psychiatric care could be better, faster, more effective, and here for those who need it.  However, inventing a treatment and having easy access to a treatment are not the same thing—the workaround accessibility for everybody,  at every moment of time, goes on.  I wrote a eulogy at the time of his passing, and <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/a-eulogy-for-nolan-ryan-williams?utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=web\">it’s available here.</a></p><p>Today, the TED talk he recorded (about Ibogaine and it’s potential to heal brain injury and PTSD) is available to us all.  This newsletter <a href=\"https://www.ted.com/talks/nolan_williams_how_ibogaine_could_treat_depression_and_anxiety?utm_campaign=tedspread&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_source=tedcomshare\">shares it</a>:</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://go.ted.com/nolanwilliams&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Nolan Willliams' Ibogaine TED Talk&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://go.ted.com/nolanwilliams\"><span>Nolan Willliams' Ibogaine TED Talk</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zzXt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1fc166_1758x980.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zzXt!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1fc166_1758x980.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zzXt!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1fc166_1758x980.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zzXt!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1fc166_1758x980.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zzXt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1fc166_1758x980.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zzXt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1fc166_1758x980.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"812\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/33c2e47a-329d-4201-90c5-1d6b2b1f