. He's a graduate of Amherst College, Child, Adolescent, and Adult Psychiatrist, and a prolific writer and podcaster. https://www.meetradial.com for more.&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1c03f44d-4506-4843-989f-0d38e66c6946_400x400.jpeg&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:100}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2024-04-25T21:45:17.228Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!s48X!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Feb12b5db-5ee2-4a60-b068-692286db9c84.heic&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/ibogaine-i&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:143025612,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:12,&quot;comment_count&quot;:2,&quot;publication_id&quot;:355550,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oO3w!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F997b8496-9b4d-43c2-b393-6f8a77945b00_1080x1080.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p></p><p>Chris Aiken, M.D., another dear friend, <a href=\"https://www.thecarlatreport.com/blogs/2-the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/post/5773-copy-of-a-more-powerful-antidepressant\">has done some wonderful recent work explaining SAINT</a> and it’s related tools in “other accelerated TMS” to the world, too:</p><div class=\"apple-podcast-container\" data-component-name=\"ApplePodcastToDom\"><iframe class=\"apple-podcast \" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000739085878&quot;,&quot;isEpisode&quot;:true,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/podcast-episode_1000739085878.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;How to Find SAINT TMS&quot;,&quot;podcastTitle&quot;:&quot;The Carlat Psychiatry Podcast&quot;,&quot;podcastByline&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:964000,&quot;numEpisodes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;targetUrl&quot;:&quot;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-to-find-saint-tms/id1463414537?i=1000739085878&amp;uo=4&quot;,&quot;releaseDate&quot;:&quot;2025-12-01T07:00:00Z&quot;}\" src=\"https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000739085878\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay *; encrypted-media *;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><div class=\"apple-podcast-container\" data-component-name=\"ApplePodcastToDom\"><iframe class=\"apple-podcast \" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000738081222&quot;,&quot;isEpisode&quot;:true,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/podcast-episode_1000738081222.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;A More Powerful Antidepressant&quot;,&quot;podcastTitle&quot;:&quot;The Carlat Psychiatry Podcast&quot;,&quot;podcastByline&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:593000,&quot;numEpisodes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;targetUrl&quot;:&quot;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/a-more-powerful-antidepressant/id1463414537?i=1000738081222&amp;uo=4&quot;,&quot;releaseDate&quot;:&quot;2025-11-24T07:00:00Z&quot;}\" src=\"https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000738081222\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay *; encrypted-media *;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><div class=\"apple-podcast-container\" data-component-name=\"ApplePodcastToDom\"><iframe class=\"apple-podcast \" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000736059436&quot;,&quot;isEpisode&quot;:true,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/podcast-episode_1000736059436.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;TMS, Teens, and Antidepressants&quot;,&quot;podcastTitle&quot;:&quot;The Carlat Psychiatry Podcast&quot;,&quot;podcastByline&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:820000,&quot;numEpisodes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;targetUrl&quot;:&quot;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/tms-teens-and-antidepressants/id1463414537?i=1000736059436&amp;uo=4&quot;,&quot;releaseDate&quot;:&quot;2025-11-10T07:00:00Z&quot;}\" src=\"https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000736059436\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay *; encrypted-media *;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><div class=\"apple-podcast-container\" data-component-name=\"ApplePodcastToDom\"><iframe class=\"apple-podcast \" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000734998143&quot;,&quot;isEpisode&quot;:true,&quot;imageUrl&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/podcast-episode_1000734998143.jpg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;How to Explain TMS&quot;,&quot;podcastTitle&quot;:&quot;The Carlat Psychiatry Podcast&quot;,&quot;podcastByline&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:1123000,&quot;numEpisodes&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;targetUrl&quot;:&quot;https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-to-explain-tms/id1463414537?i=1000734998143&amp;uo=4&quot;,&quot;releaseDate&quot;:&quot;2025-11-03T07:00:00Z&quot;}\" src=\"https://embed.podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-carlat-psychiatry-podcast/id1463414537?i=1000734998143\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay *; encrypted-media *;\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe></div><p>He was loved, and his love and rigor will be saving lives for years to come.  </p><p>Thank you, Nolan.</p><p>For those who didn't know him, he was a giant man—really physically large.  He loved kite surf, he loved sweet tea, he loved the southern food from his native South Carolina, and loved his family, and he loved all of us, with all of his time, and more of his life force than anyone has spare.  Thanks for reading.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lPAo!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc93b52-5b5a-428a-87e8-1b2b8830d6ff_3670x2015.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lPAo!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc93b52-5b5a-428a-87e8-1b2b8830d6ff_3670x2015.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lPAo!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc93b52-5b5a-428a-87e8-1b2b8830d6ff_3670x2015.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lPAo!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc93b52-5b5a-428a-87e8-1b2b8830d6ff_3670x2015.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lPAo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcbc93b52-5b5a-428a-87e8-1b2b8830d6ff_3670x2015.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lPAo!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:s